<span id="S1.T1.3.1.1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S1.T1.3.1.1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">DINO-ViT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite></span>
