<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F6.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="S6.F6.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Evaluation of the <span id="S6.F6.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LaSt-ViT</span> in feature norm. Specifically, the elimination of artifacts also removes the high-norm phenomena <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite>, highlighting our deeper perspective on addressing artifacts.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
