<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Evaluation results on <span id="S6.T5.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">open-vocabulary benchmark</span>.
Our results are marked in <span id="S6.T5.16" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">gray</span>. <span id="S6.T5.17" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LazyStrike</span> consistently enhances performance on open-vocabulary dense tasks, by demonstrating that frozen ViT can achieve comparable performance with ConvNet <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite>. </figcaption>
</figure>
